            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.67</h2><ul><li>Adds Hermes Agent support for VoiceClaw Realtime Bridge and HTTPS Tunnel routes.</li><li>Routes Hermes turns through the local Hermes CLI with VoiceClaw session continuity.</li><li>Keeps existing OpenClaw, GPT-Realtime-2, and GPT-5.5 route behavior intact.</li></ul>
]]></description>
