            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.66</h2><ul><li>Adds long-running OpenClaw Realtime job handoff endpoints for iPhone and Apple Watch bridge/tunnel modes.</li><li>Raises OpenClaw reply and watch relay waits to at least 10 minutes so slower agent work is not cut off prematurely.</li><li>Keeps completed OpenClaw Realtime job results available long enough for clients to poll and retrieve them reliably.</li></ul>
]]></description>
